{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"2CO","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"哥林多后书","commonName":"哥林多后书","title":"哥林多后书","order":47,"numberOfChapters":13,"sha256":"72b1061cc86dce53418169bc52aa5129601cef464e3676ce67f900ee20efdee1","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/2CO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":13,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/2CO/13.json","totalNumberOfVerses":257},"chapter":{"number":9,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["帮助圣徒的捐款"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["论到供给圣徒的事，我不必写信给你们；"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["因为我知道你们乐意的心，常对马其顿人夸奖你们，说亚该亚人预备好了，已经有一年了；并且你们的热心激动了许多人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["但我打发那几位弟兄去，要叫你们照我的话预备妥当，免得我们在这事上夸奖你们的话落了空。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["万一有马其顿人与我同去，见你们没有预备，就叫我们所确信的，反成了羞愧；你们羞愧，更不用说了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["因此，我想不得不求那几位弟兄先到你们那里去，把从前所应许的捐资预备妥当，就显出你们所捐的是出于乐意，不是出于勉强。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["「少种的少收，多种的多收」，这话是真的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["各人要随本心所酌定的，不要作难，不要勉强，因为捐得乐意的人是 神所喜爱的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["神能将各样的恩惠多多地加给你们，使你们凡事常常充足，能多行各样善事。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["如经上所记：",{"text":"他施舍钱财，周济贫穷；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的仁义存到永远。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["那赐种给撒种的，赐粮给人吃的，必多多加给你们种地的种子，又增添你们仁义的果子；"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["叫你们凡事富足，可以多多施舍，就借着我们使感谢归于 神。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["因为办这供给的事，不但补圣徒的缺乏，而且叫许多人越发感谢 神。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["他们从这供给的事上得了凭据，知道你们承认基督顺服他的福音，多多地捐钱给他们和众人，便将荣耀归与 神。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["他们也因 神极大的恩赐显在你们心里，就切切地想念你们，为你们祈祷。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["感谢 神，因他有说不尽的恩赐！"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/2CO/9.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/2CO/10.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/2CO/8.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":15}